  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">philly cheesesteak brings the sizzle to your kitchen with tender beef, caramelized onions, and bell peppers tucked under a blanket of creamy provolone inside a crusty roll. Steam rises as you press that first bite, and the juicy meat, sweet peppers, and mellow cheese dance together. A splash of rich beef broth and a hint of apple cider vinegar step in for wine, creating a savory marinade that boosts every slice. Whether it is a cozy family dinner or a late-night craving, this cheesesteak wraps you in iconic flavor, pure comfort, and pure joy.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-philly-cheesesteak\">Why You’ll Love This Philly Cheesesteak</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-philly-cheesesteak\">How to Make Philly Cheesesteak</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-philly-cheesesteak\">Pro Tips for Making Philly Cheesesteak</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-philly-cheesesteak\">How to Serve this Philly Cheesesteak</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-philly-cheesesteak\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This Philly Cheesesteak</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>It&#8217;s a warm hug in sandwich form, perfect for any occasion.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Loaded with tender beef and gooey cheese, it’s pure comfort food.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Quick and easy to make, you’ll have dinner on the table in no time.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Customize it with your favorite toppings for a personal touch.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Every bite is a delicious adventure that will leave you craving more!</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=